Thank you for your interest in contributing to the project!

Below are steps in how you can do so:
1. Fork the repository.
2. Create a new branch for your changes.
3. Make your changes.
4. Test your code locally before submitting.
5. Submit a pull request with a short explanation of what you changed.

Contribution Guidelines:
- Game needs to continue to be functional
- Uses Python 3 (and can have suggestion edits to use later python versions if you so choose)
- Be clear and readable
- Follow basic Python style conventions
- Include a clear description in the pull request

Where to report bugs or request features:
https://github.com/tpiscoding/Rock-Paper-Scissors_Game/issues
